SUMMARY:Intermediate Ride (C) - BI ARC Third Loop (37R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, an
 d Ride Together**\n\nRide leader: volunteer to lead!\nRide sweep: voluntee
 r to sweep!\nAnticipated Average Pace: (14-16 mph)\nRoute: https://ridewit
 hgps.com/routes/33796993\n\nThis is an Intermediate C Class ride. The ride
  leader will ride at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be 
 a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do
  his/her best to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and/o
 r splitting into multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease 
 do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. If yo
 u exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged t
 o join a faster group. If maintaining a 14-16 mph average is beyond your c
 urrent ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHel
 mets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit 
 (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing ar
 ound a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RS
 VP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club m
 ember. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content
 .aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide b
 y the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikec
 lub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidan
 ce if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net
 /content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
