SUMMARY:York Heritage Trail 32 miles flat RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nJoin your friends on a ri
 de from the Wilmington Club and Lancaster club. We will leave from the Bri
 llhart Station Parking Lot (South of York) at 1pm. We will bike South 16 m
 iles to New FreedomRailroad\, for those who wish\, stopping at Bonkey's be
 fore heading back. We should arrive back around 5pm. This is a casual ride
 . Please do not join us unless you promise to stay with the group. We will
  ride as a group with no one left behind. Like always every rider must wea
 r a helmet and have a tube that can be used to fix a flat.\nFor the Lancas
 ter Members: To eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we encou
 rage LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. RSVP als
 o allows us to contact you after the ride if needed. If you do not RSVP yo
 u are not covered by the club excess accident insurance policy\; only club
  members who RSVP are covered. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a clu
 b member. Join here- [https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_
 id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_
 id=60&club_id=257148)\nRichard Conner\, leader717-572-8480
